- The markers are the ones which the Scala compiler's `NameKinds` defines. They are held in
- `StackTrace.Marker.all`, and `StackTrace.legend` is derived from them, for rendering beside a
- trace:
+ Los marcadores son los que define `NameKinds` del compilador de Scala. Se guardan en
+ `StackTrace.Marker.all`, y `StackTrace.legend` se deriva de ellos, para representarla junto a una
+ traza:

